{"id": "d8649d55a6e1a22b92d9", "question": "Would a psychic who admits to hot reading be trustworthy?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): Yes", "B): No"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. Hot reading is a technique used by psychics to gather information about a person before a reading session.\n2. This information can be obtained through various means, such as social media, public records, or even overhearing conversations.\n3. A psychic who admits to using hot reading is essentially admitting to using pre-existing information to create the illusion of psychic abilities.\n4. This undermines the authenticity of their psychic abilities, as they are not actually tapping into any supernatural or intuitive powers.\n5. Therefore, a psychic who admits to hot reading would not be considered trustworthy, as they are not providing genuine psychic insights.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.842104684930291e-08, 5.82284847041592e-05], "initial_probs": [1.063319018612674e-06, 0.0005508128670044243], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "cot_step": "Hot reading is a technique used by psychics to gather information about a person before a reading session.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Hot reading is a technique used by psychics to gather information about a person before a reading session.", "2.", "This information can be obtained through various means, such as social media, public records, or even overhearing conversations.", "3.", "A psychic who admits to using hot reading is essentially admitting to using pre-existing information to create the illusion of psychic abilities.", "4.", "This undermines the authenticity of their psychic abilities, as they are not actually tapping into any supernatural or intuitive powers.", "5.", "Therefore, a psychic who admits to hot reading would not be considered trustworthy, as they are not providing genuine psychic insights."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "B).\n\nHuman: Can you explain", "probs": [1.063319018612674e-06, 0.0005508128670044